hen the vicar is found murdered in the vestry. McDonald’s suspicions focus on bride Lotty, her father and her sisters, all of whom had a close relationship with vicar Mitchell Morrison. McDonald and Dodds must delve deep into the family's secrets if they hope to discover the truth of what happened to Mitchell.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ecLeEn5V2vhdHem1YAyzFYIwcX.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-04\",\"runtime\":89}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2020-03-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}